  "details": "Regarding the drone.\n\nits super nice but i would like inversion options for all axis as well as controller configuration per preset. depending on how i setup my drone i want different controls to do different stuff.\n\n for example for racing since the propellers are in front \n\nroll => yaw movement and \n\nthrottle => forward \n\nyaw => Inverted roll (thats why an option to invert that axis as well would be nice)\n\nbut if i wanna be slow/cinematic the propellers are up meaning \n\nyaw => yaw but \n\npitch => forward\n\nroll => sideways \n\natm i need to change the settings everytime i wanna switch between different styles if i want the same controller inputs to do the same thing on each profile",
